<details name="faq">
<summary><b>🧭 What does “maintained” mean here?</b></summary>

Counts are captured from the GitHub REST API by `bun run tools capture`, so they are refreshed
rather than hand-tuned. No badge service is involved.

<!-- repo-hygiene:start -->
```text
